{"id":7,"profile":{"ID":6830,"title":"Ben Erwin","content":"","attr_title":"","menu_type":"profile","url":"\/profile\/ben-erwin\/","slug":"ben-erwin","parent":"6825","coords":"","offset":"","confirmation_status":"","event_length_seconds":"","point_of_contact":"","guest_type":"","event_type":"","appearance_type":"","notes":"","classes":[""],"post":{"ID":7,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2021-07-05 19:04:21","post_date_gmt":"2021-07-05 19:04:21","post_content":"\u003C!-- wp:heading --\u003E\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003EChampioning XR Industry Advancement through Leadership, Collaboration, and Innovation\u003C\/h2\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:heading --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAs the creator of The Polys - WebXR Awards, WebXR Summit Series, and MetaTr@versal, Ben Erwin has made a lasting impact on the XR industry by catalyzing awareness and engagement with the immersive web. With over three decades of experience as an internet frontiersman, he has been instrumental in advancing the industry through the recognition of its pioneers and providing advocacy platforms for thought leaders.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBen's diverse background includes serving as a developer and executive for digital media agencies, where he created data-driven interactives for numerous major brands. In addition, he dedicated 13 years as a webmaster and consultant for the United Nations humanitarian section and partner NGOs, raising awareness for women and children in conflict areas worldwide.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA digital polymath, Ben's expertise spans marketing, management, programming, video editing, and writing. His experience in the browser wars led him to collaborate with XR industry leadership in producing the MetaTr@versal series of events. These gatherings galvanize the community around cooperation on the development and adoption of open standards and platform interoperability for the Metaverse.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPassionate about the potential of immersive content as a positive means for evolved human communication in areas like civics, journalism, and education, Ben shines a light on innovators' good works to preserve their legacy and inspire others to build upon it.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a network of over 12,000 LinkedIn followers and 10,500 connections, Ben Erwin exemplifies dedication to the XR industry's growth, championing its advancement through leadership, collaboration, and innovation.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E","post_title":"Ben Erwin","post_excerpt":"Ben is the Creator of \nThe Polys WebXR Awards,\nWebXR Summit Series, and \nMetaTr@versal.\nCo-Founder, Ready Player Golf","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"ben-erwin","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2023-10-12 15:26:22","post_modified_gmt":"2023-10-12 15:26:22","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https:\/\/webxrsummitseries\/?post_type=profile&#038;p=7","menu_order":0,"post_type":"profile","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw"},"post_type":"profile","meta":{"_edit_lock":["1697124347:1"],"_edit_last":["1"],"_thumbnail_id":["6768"],"twitter":["https:\/\/twitter.com\/powersimple"],"linkedin":["https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/powersimple\/"],"discord":["Ben Erwin#2954"],"company":["The Poly Awards"],"contact_title":["Creator"],"profile_title":["Creator; Executive Producer"],"github":["https:\/\/github.com\/powersimple"],"talk_description":["Welcoming our worldwide audience to the WebXR community and thanking our team, our sponsors and our speakers."],"timezone":["-7| PDT"],"_yoast_wpseo_primary_category":["2"],"_yo